provenance.p:
Manuscript pencil annotation by George Appleyard (-1855), secretary and librarian to Earl SpencerAppleyard, George, -1855, front endpaper verso: Three leaves are fac-similes;
                  vizt. The first leaf - Nel mezzo. Tenth - Or incomincian. Eleventh - Se fossamica. Collated, with Mr. Payne's copy [i.e. John Thomas Payne], with Mr. Foss [i.e. Henry Foss] - 19
                  March 1855 Geo. Appleyard.
